# Byte-compiled / build artefacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Structures downloaded or produced by a run. Test fixtures under tests/data/
# are deliberately tracked (added with `git add -f`) — the suite needs real
# structures, and an earlier blanket ignore here is why every fixture was a
# synthetic poly-alanine rod and why eight residue-pairing bugs went unnoticed.
*.pdb
*.cif
*.mmcif
!tests/data/*.pdb
!tests/data/*.cif
*.zip
*.npz

# Notebooks and scratch output. The plot names are anchored to the repo root:
# that is where a CLI run drops them, and an unanchored pattern also hid
# docs/images/summary.png from the README.
*.ipynb
/rmsd.png
/summary.png
.superpowers/
